      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oak_Ridge_North%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s development was taken over in 1969 and later led by Associated Properties Company in 1971, expanding the subdivision.",
